    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "eKA7SFmvnlSU"
      },
      "source": [
        "**Step 2:** Write a conditional statement that tells the user what movies they can see. The logic should work as follows:\n",
        "\n",
        "* If the user is 12 or below, your code should print \"You may see movies rated G or PG\"\n",
        "* If the user is between 13 and 16 years old, your code should print \"You may see movies rated PG-13 or below\"\n",
        "* If the user is 17 or older, your code should print \"You can see any movie without parental guidance!\""
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 7,
      "metadata": {
        "id": "zpmiiXklnlSU",
        "outputId": "6963ce6a-81a3-4cba-fa84-ff8b0958e128",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        }
      },
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "You can see any movie without parental guidance!\n",
            "You can see any movie without parental guidance!\n",
            "You can see any movie without parental guidance!\n",
            "You may see movies rated G or PG\n",
            "You may see movies rated PG-13 or below\n",
            "You may see movies rated PG-13 or below\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
        "age = [30, 45, 50, 11, 15, 16]\n",
        "for user in age:\n",
        "  if user > 17:\n",
        "    print(f'You can see any movie without parental guidance!')\n",
        "  elif  13 <= user <= 16:\n",
        "    print(f'You may see movies rated PG-13 or below')\n",
        "  else:\n",
        "    print(f'You may see movies rated G or PG')\n"
      ]
